                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Game runs flawlessly in 2026 on modern systems. Running in compatibility for Windows Vista at 1920x1080, with no crashes so far. The only downside is that it uses DirectInput to register controllers, so you'll have to suffer through moments of having to enter specific button combinations. Thankfully the game was meant for kids, so you can pretty much solve it by guessing or just mashing every button on your controller until it works lol. Pure nostalgia.",
